```python
import json
from pathlib import Path

class ConfigurationError(Exception):
    pass

def load_config(path: Path) -> dict:
    try:
        return json.loads(path.read_text(encoding="utf-8"))
    except json.JSONDecodeError as err:
        raise ConfigurationError(f"{path.name}: invalid JSON at line {err.lineno}") from err
```

| Block | Runs when |
|---|---|
| `try`. | always first. |
| `except X as err`. | an X (or subclass) was raised inside try. |
| `else`. | try finished without an exception. |
| `finally`. | always, even after return or raise. |

